    "created_at": "2020-06-24T12:51:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-24T12:51:19Z",
    "body": "As would inserting a control using `del::before` and `del::after` to block the ligation.\r\n\r\n(As it happens, inserting ZWNJ doesn't actually work with Fira Code; its \"ligature\" rules don't respect this. But other options such as ZWSP or Word Joiner do work to block it.)",
